    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010400/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1704268387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010400/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1704268387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010400/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1704268387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010400/extras/a81317892db3e584bcde8df697f26186.avif?t=1704268387\" /></div><br><strong>Hell Green Blue</strong> - is an immersive 2D action-adventure puzzle game that thrusts players into a world dominated by the malevolent red color, symbolizing evil and chaos. In a desperate attempt to save the world from imminent annihilation, a group of courageous heroes embarks on a treacherous journey deep into the dark catacombs of Hell.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010400/extras/60eb77851c26a2681abd706401a43fb3.poster.avif?t=1704268387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010400/extras/60eb77851c26a2681abd706401a43fb3.webm?t=1704268387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010400/extras/60eb77851c26a2681abd706401a43fb3.mp4?t=1704268387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique Color-Based Gameplay: &quot;Hell Green Blue&quot; offers a refreshing twist on traditional action-adventure games by incorporating a color-based gameplay mechanic. Players must shoot colored projectiles in specific sequences to unlock doors, solve puzzles, and defeat guardians.<br></li><li>Challenging Puzzle Elements: The game presents players with intricate puzzles and brain-teasing challenges throughout the dark catacombs of Hell. Success requires not only quick reflexes but also strategic thinking and clever use of colors.<br></li><li>Intense Boss Battles: Prepare to face terrifying guardians that serve as the formidable bosses of Hell. Each guardian possesses distinct color-manipulating abilities, making every encounter a thrilling and unique showdown.<br></li><li>Weapon and Skill Upgrades: As players progress, they collect &quot;Hell Green Blue&quot; essence, which can be used to upgrade their blaster and unlock new skills. These upgrades are crucial for overcoming the increasingly difficult obstacles and foes.<br></li><li>Atmospheric Visuals and Soundtrack: Immerse yourself in the haunting ambiance of Hell's catacombs through the game's dark and atmospheric visuals. The captivating soundtrack complements the gameplay, intensifying the overall experience.</li></ul>",
